winkagent --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `codex fork`, `winkagent exec`, and `winkagent exec fork`
codex fork --worktree: `codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
codex fork --worktree --last: `codex fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
winkagent exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `winkagent exec fork --worktree`
winkagent exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
winkagent resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `codex fork`, `winkagent exec`, and `winkagent exec fork`
codex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `codex fork`, `winkagent exec`, and `winkagent exec fork`
codex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `codex fork`, `winkagent exec`, and `winkagent exec fork`
